WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/admin/components/devtools/ReferenceLinksSection.tsx (36 L) — an anonymous, PURE presentational
  leaf. It maps the static `REFERENCE_LINKS` constant (features/admin/components/devtools/constants.ts) into a
  responsive grid (grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4) of cards. Each card:
    GlassPanel(hover, p-4) → <a href={link.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> with
      • a 36×36 (h-9 w-9) rounded-lg icon box tinted by ICON_COLOR_MAP.cyan
        (bg-neon-cyan/10 text-neon-cyan ring-1 ring-neon-cyan/20), holding the lucide glyph resolved via
        ICON_MAP[link.icon] ?? BookOpen (BookOpen / Globe / ExternalLink / Radio);
      • the localized title `t(link.title)` (text-sm font-medium text-white);
      • the href, truncated (text-xs text-[var(--text-muted)]).
  Data sources: `useTranslation` only. No data hooks → the web leaf has exactly ONE render branch (the grid).
  i18n keys it consumes (the 4 REFERENCE_LINKS `title` keys; absent from the web en catalog, so the web renders
  the raw key text): devtools.ref.fleetOverview / devtools.ref.partnerEndpoints / devtools.ref.devPortal /
  devtools.ref.telemetryGuide.

